    "lawCode": "Amd §3-300, Vil L; amd §3, Pub Off L",
    "lawSection": "Village Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S6752\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act to amend the village law and the public\nofficers law, in relation to authorizing the village of Mannsville to\nhire a village clerk who is not a resident of such village\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nTo authorizing the village of Mannsville to hire a village clerk who\nis not a resident of the village.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSection 1: Amends section 3-300 of the village law by adding a new\nsubdivision 27.\n\nSection 2: Amends section 3 of the public officers law by adding a new\nsection 66.\n\nSection 3: Sets forth the effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThe village of Mannsville, in Jefferson County, is unable to fill a\nvillage clerk position due to the residency requirement in town law\nand public officer's law. As an effort to fill this position with an\ninterested and qualified individual, the village of Mannsville seeks\nto draw applicants from adjoining towns.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nTo be determined\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
